{"ref":"BDB, עַוָּל","hw":"עַוָּל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עַוָּל</span></big>  <strong>n.m. unjust, unrighteous one</strong>;—especially of oppressive ruler <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:5\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.5\">Zp 3:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 18:21\" href=\"/Job.18.21\">Jb 18:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 27:7\" href=\"/Job.27.7\">27:7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רָשָׁע</span>), <a data-ref=\"Job 29:17\" href=\"/Job.29.17\">29:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 31:3\" href=\"/Job.31.3\">31:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">פֹּעֲלֵי אָ֑וֶן</span>); prob. also <a data-ref=\"Job 16:11\" href=\"/Job.16.11\">16:11</a> (for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲוִיל</span>, so Di; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רְשָׁעִים</span>).","next":"BDB, עוֹלָה","prev":"BDB, עֲוִיל³"}